flowchart TD
    U[Guests and Hotel Staff] --> APP[Hotel Application / API]
    APP --> AUTH[Authentication and Authorisation]
    AUTH --> PG[(PostgreSQL Primary<br/>Bookings, Rooms, Payments)]
    PG -->|Replication stream| REPL[(Read Replica<br/>Read-only reports)]
    APP -->|Flexible preferences| MONGO[(MongoDB<br/>Guest Preference Documents)]
    PG --> BACKUP[Encrypted Backups / Object Storage]
    REPL --> REPORTS[Management Reports]
    MON[Monitoring, Logs and Alerts] --- PG
    MON --- REPL
    MON --- MONGO
